    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MADGUN is a super-fast, old-school first-person shooter. This game combines the gameplay of the old Doom and the dynamism of Quake.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315140/extras/330ea8067753956cb6a6ea2de0e7febf.poster.avif?t=1720787492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315140/extras/330ea8067753956cb6a6ea2de0e7febf.webm?t=1720787492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315140/extras/330ea8067753956cb6a6ea2de0e7febf.mp4?t=1720787492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br>The main character is a commando with the call sign MADGUN. You have to complete a special mission in the monster prison where you have to free... / / { data classified } / /<br><br>You have to kill a lot of prison defenders and defeat the bosses guarding the sacred keys to get out of the prison.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315140/extras/b710f5fe0d8577a1a49670b590a27cb1.poster.avif?t=1720787492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315140/extras/b710f5fe0d8577a1a49670b590a27cb1.webm?t=1720787492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315140/extras/b710f5fe0d8577a1a49670b590a27cb1.mp4?t=1720787492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use the entire arsenal of weapons - from a knife to a grenade launcher, to kill ruthless monsters, as well as their bosses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315140/extras/9cc1aa80c9074db6fb80fece449f3c9c.poster.avif?t=1720787492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315140/extras/9cc1aa80c9074db6fb80fece449f3c9c.webm?t=1720787492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315140/extras/9cc1aa80c9074db6fb80fece449f3c9c.mp4?t=1720787492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collect the maximum number of points and show how professional you are.<br><br>Find secret levels and learn more about the world you've entered.",
